{"words": [{"text": "۞ سَيَقُولُ", "translation": "Will say"}, {"text": "ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ", "translation": "the foolish ones"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "translation": "the people"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "What"}, {"text": "وَلَّىٰهُمْ", "translation": "(has) turned them"}, {"text": "عَن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "قِبْلَتِهِمُ", "translation": "their direction of prayer"}, {"text": "ٱلَّتِى", "translation": "which"}, {"text": "كَانُوا۟", "translation": "they were used to"}, {"text": "عَلَيْهَا ۚ", "translation": "[on it]"}, {"text": "قُل", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "لِّلَّهِ", "translation": "For Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَشْرِقُ", "translation": "(is) the east"}, {"text": "وَٱلْمَغْرِبُ ۚ", "translation": "and the west"}, {"text": "يَهْدِى", "translation": "He guides"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "whom"}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ", "translation": "He wills"}, {"text": "إِلَىٰ", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "صِرَٰطٍۢ", "translation": "a path"}, {"text": "مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ", "translation": "straight"}], "sahih": "The foolish among the people will say, \"What has turned them away from their qiblah,1 which they used to face?\"2 Say, \"To Allāh belongs the east and the west. He guides whom He wills to a straight path.\""}